! Lab 08: Wireless Access Point and VLAN Integration
! Platform: Cisco Packet Tracer
! Devices: SW1, Wireless Access Point, Wireless Laptop
! Purpose:
! - Configure a wireless access point
! - Configure wireless SSID and security
! - Connect wireless clients to the network
! - Understand how wireless devices integrate into VLAN networks
! - Verify wireless client connectivity
! - Verify wireless traffic reaches VLAN gateway

! Configure AP1 wireless settings
! SSID:
! Company-WiFi

! Wireless security:
! WPA2 Personal

! Passphrase:
! *****

! AP1 connected to:
! SW1 Fa0/20

! SW1 Fa0/20 configured as access port in VLAN 10

! Connect CEO-Laptop to Company-WiFi

! CEO-Laptop wireless settings:
! SSID: Company-WiFi
! Password: *****

! Static IP used because Packet Tracer wireless DHCP bridging was unreliable

! CEO-Laptop IP configuration:
! IP address:      192.168.10.50
! Subnet mask:     255.255.255.0
! Default gateway: 192.168.10.1

! Verify wireless connectivity
ping 192.168.10.1

! Result:
! successful replies

! Wireless client successfully connected to VLAN 10 network through AP1

! Save configuration
write memory
